    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Running the cradle",
      "text": [
        "The bound effigy goes in the cradle's **first** slot and Spiritweave in the **second**.",
        "Every **ten seconds** it tries once to call the creature onto a clear, dry floor within **3 blocks**, on its own level. A summon costs **80 Pulse**, **one Spiritweave** and **one thread**. A failed or blocked try spends nothing.",
        "The cradle keeps a **2,400 Pulse** reserve and refills it by up to 80 a second from generators within 8."
      ]
    },
