    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Limits and automation",
      "text": [
        "It pauses while **8 or more** mobs are within 12 blocks, so move them away. Hostiles are never called in Peaceful or inside a Hush Totem's circle.",
        "A comparator reads the threads left. Redstone pauses everything.",
        "Hoppers can feed Spiritweave in from above or the sides. The bottom face hands out only an exhausted effigy, ready for renewal.",
        "Breaking the cradle drops the same effigy with its remaining threads intact."
